    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>The Double Vibroblade is essentially two curved <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vibroblade\" title=\"Vibroblade\">Vibroblades</a> (designed exclusively for slashing attacks) attached to a central, twisted hilt. Though difficult to control, when used properly it is an effective close-combat weapon. </p><p>A Double Vibroblade is a Double Weapon. You can attack with both ends of the weapon as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Full-Round_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Round Action\">Full-Round Action</a>, but both attack rolls take a -10 penalty (although certain <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Talents\" title=\"Talents\">Talents</a> can reduce these penalties). </p><p>A Double Vibroblade requires two <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Energy_Cell\" title=\"Energy Cell\">Energy Cells</a> to operate. </p>",
